\newlabel{thm:ev-rate}{{C.14}{183}{Matching $m^{-1/2}$ bounds for the label-free channel}{theorem.C.14}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.11}{\ignorespaces The evidence-channel rate (Thm~\ref {thm:ev-rate}). Empirical minimax error tracks the Le Cam curve $c_0/\sqrt  m$ (slope $-0.525$); per-sample KL grows quadratically in the separation (KL$/\varepsilon ^2$ constant); the labeled-vs-evidence efficiency ratio is constant in $m$ but grows as $c_{\min }\to 0$.}}{184}{figure.C.11}\protected@file@percent }
