\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.12}{\ignorespaces Closing Conjecture~\ref {conj:gen} (Thm~\ref {thm:conj1-dichotomy}): the swap flips every benefit sign (multiclass $K{=}5$, left; regression, middle) while no label-free observable of any order moves (right, exact zero) --- so no testable assumption can bracket the sign, and the residual is exactly one bit.}}{186}{figure.C.12}\protected@file@percent }
